## Why This Is Asked
Tests cross-process, offline-first syncing, and conflict resolution at scale in Android apps, mirroring enterprise chat/presence needs.

## Key Concepts
- Isolated processes and AIDL IPC
- Encrypted Room storage (SQLCipher)
- CRDTs (OR-Set) for multi-device merges
- TLS WebSocket with backoff and per-device tokens
- Privacy controls and key rotation

